sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as Administrator
    actor Customer
    participant UI as Commerce console
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Model as Forecast service
    Admin->>UI: Register customer and catalogue
    UI->>API: Authorized registration
    API->>DB: Save account and master data
    Customer->>UI: Create international order
    UI->>API: JWT, payload and idempotency key
    API->>DB: Lock customer and inventory
    API->>DB: Reserve and save order, payment, shipment, audit
    DB-->>API: Commit
    API-->>UI: Order ID, items, charges and tracking
    Admin->>UI: Advance shipment to delivery
    UI->>API: Valid next event
    API->>DB: Lock order, capture and deduct once
    Admin->>UI: Import daily sales and run forecast
    UI->>API: Validated CSV then horizon
    API->>Model: Evaluate and forecast
    Model->>DB: Read history and current available stock
    Model->>DB: Save predictions, recommendations and evaluation
    Admin->>UI: Download executive report
    UI->>API: Request report
    API->>DB: Aggregate business records
    API-->>UI: CSV with defined units and currencies
